Step 4 — API Gateway → Lambda

PURPOSE:
Why?
We're creating:
Client
  ↓ POST /devices
API Gateway
  ↓
Lambda
API Gateway becomes the HTTP entry point, while Lambda handles the actual processing.

HANDSON:
Go to:
AWS Console → API Gateway → Create API
Choose:
REST API → Build
Set:
- API name: InterviewAPI
- Endpoint type: Regional
Click Create API.
Create resource
Go to Resources → Create Resource
- Resource name: devices
- Resource path: /devices
Create it.
Create POST method
Select /devices → Create method → POST
Integration:
Lambda Function
Select:
InterviewLambda
Allow API Gateway to invoke the Lambda when prompted.
Click Create.
